# The window's close button with the DualSense triggers in use (src/pc_triggers.cpp): boot to free roam, a few seconds of throttle
# (the triggers are on), then `close` (WM_CLOSE, the path of the close button and Alt+F4: MclaApp::OnWindowCloseRequested). The log must show both
# triggers released ("-> off ... (shutdown)") before the game's "hard-exiting". Run with the same options as pc-triggers.pad.
include boot-to-roam.pad
mark trig_close_drive
trigger rt 1 50f
trigger rt 0.6
stick lx 1 40f
trigger rt 1
wait 4s 240f
log TRIG close: WM_CLOSE with the triggers on
mark trig_close
close
wait 20s
mark trig_close_end
